OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785487699
OL,3,CUefa to boycott World Cup if Fifa's
OL,4,Cplan to invite private investors goes
OL,5,Cahead
OL,7,FUefa has said it will boycott the
OL,8,FWorld Cup if a plan to sell stakes in
OL,9,Fthe tournament to private investors
OL,10,Fgoes ahead as proposed.
OL,12,FFollowing a virtual meeting of
OL,13,FEuropean football's governing body on
OL,14,FThursday, all members voted
OL,15,Funanimously to boycott all men's and
OL,16,Fwomen's tournaments organised by Fifa
OL,17,Fif the controversial investment plan
OL,18,Fis approved.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
