PN,31302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785487699
OL,3,CUefa to boycott World Cup if Fifa's
OL,4,Cplan to invite private investors goes
OL,5,Cahead
OL,7,FA statement issued on behalf of all
OL,8,FUefa members said all 55 of its member
OL,9,Fassociations, including the English
OL,10,FFA, "stand as one" as they
OL,11,F"unequivocally reject Fifa's proposal".
OL,13,F"The World Cup cannot be treated as an
OL,14,Finvestment product. It is one of
OL,15,Ffootball's greatest sporting
OL,16,Flegacies," Uefa added.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785487699
OL,3,CUefa to boycott World Cup if Fifa's
OL,4,Cplan to invite private investors goes
OL,5,Cahead
OL,7,F"It has been built over generations by
OL,8,Fplayers, national teams and supporters
OL,9,Facross every continent. No part of it
OL,10,Fshould ever be surrendered to private
OL,11,Finvestors. The World Cup is not for
OL,12,Fsale.
OL,14,F"It is both irresponsible and
OL,15,Findefensible that a proposal of such
OL,16,Fsignificance for football was
OL,17,Fconceived in secret and brought to the
OL,18,Fbrink of approval without any
OL,19,Fmeaningful consultation with those
OL,20,Fentrusted with stewarding the game.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785487699
OL,3,CUefa to boycott World Cup if Fifa's
OL,4,Cplan to invite private investors goes
OL,5,Cahead
OL,7,F"This is not merely a profound failure
OL,8,Fof leadership, but an abdication of
OL,9,FFifa's duty as the custodian of world
OL,10,Ffootball."
OL,12,FFifa is proposing to sell stakes in
OL,13,Fits major competitions - including the
OL,14,FWorld Cup - to private backers under a
OL,15,Fscheme led by the brother of Donald
OL,16,FTrump's son-in-law.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785487699
OL,3,CUefa to boycott World Cup if Fifa's
OL,4,Cplan to invite private investors goes
OL,5,Cahead
OL,7,FIt wants to set up a new private
OL,8,Fcompany, called Fifa Forward
OL,9,FEnterprise (FFE), which would take
OL,10,Fcontrol of all commercial and event
OL,11,Foperations, including the World Cup.
OL,13,FFifa has insisted it would remain the
OL,14,Fgame's global governing body and would
OL,15,Fretain a majority stake in FFE, but
OL,16,Fresistance by many associations has
OL,17,Fbeen fierce, with Uefa accusing Fifa
OL,18,Fof "attempting to sell the soul of
OL,19,Ffootball".
OL,26,@zD@DOU{D@IO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
