PN,31306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785487699
OL,3,CUefa to boycott World Cup if Fifa's
OL,4,Cplan to invite private investors goes
OL,5,Cahead
OL,7,FOn Wednesday, Fifa President Gianni
OL,8,FInfantino issued an ultimatum to
OL,9,Fmembers, giving them a deadline of
OL,10,FSeptember 19 to make a decision. He
OL,11,Falso warned of reduced funding if a
OL,12,Fmajority of members did not vote for
OL,13,Fthe scheme.
OL,15,FHe said a $10 billion (#7.5 billion)
OL,16,Ffunding package for football
OL,17,Fdevelopment, which would give each
OL,18,Fmember access to up to $40 million
OL,19,Ffrom January, would be stripped down
OL,20,Fto $2.7billion (around #2 billion) if
OL,21,Fthe plan is rejected.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785487699
OL,3,CUefa to boycott World Cup if Fifa's
OL,4,Cplan to invite private investors goes
OL,5,Cahead
OL,7,F"National associations around the
OL,8,Fworld are now presented with an
OL,9,Fultimatum: accept the irreversible
OL,10,Fcapture of football's greatest
OL,11,Fcompetitions or bear the
OL,12,Fconsequences," Uefa said in its
OL,13,Fstatement.
OL,15,F"This is not a 'democratic decision',
OL,16,Fbut governance by intimidation ` an
OL,17,Fact of coercion unworthy of an
OL,18,Finstitution entrusted with the
OL,19,Fstewardship of the global game."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
